 and balanced lifestyle.\nRM 4,738 / mo\n\n* * *\n\nImage: photo\n\nPhotos\n\nMap View\n\n## Property details\n\nImage: home-open-oService Residence for sale  | Image: furnished-oPartially furnished\nImage: document-with-lines-oCompleted in 2026  | Image: calendar-days-oFreehold tenure\nImage: calendar-time-oListed on 8 Sep 2026  | Image: document-with-lines-oListing ID - 502049028\n\n## About this property\n\n### Desa Park City Newly Completed Noora Residence Noora Walk\n\nElite Serviced Residence in Desa ParkCity — Retail at Your Doorstep\nNoora Walk!\nEnjoy the best of Desa ParkCity living in this outstanding development\nUnit Details:\nLayout Type B\n1+1 Bedrooms\n1 Bathroom\nBuilt-up: 651 sq. ft.\n2 Car Parks (Tandem)\nFacing Park Regent and the lake at Centreal Park\nSelling Price: RM1.10 million\nWhy This Property?\n**Prestigious Desa ParkCity address\nDeveloped by ParkCity Group, this project embodies a Scandinavian design ethos, emphasizing light, simplicity, and a seamless connection with nature. Launched in November 2022 and slated for completion in 2026, Noora integrates residential living with the convenience of on-site retail, offering a wholesome and balanced lifestyle. Noora stands on a 6.63-acre plot and consists of two 52-storey towers that house a total of 1,156 residential units. The development's name, meaning \"light\" in Scandinavian languages, is reflected in its light-filled architecture and airy, open spaces. At its base, Noora features \"Noora Walk,\" a three-storey, 50,000 sq ft retail component managed by the developer, designed to host a curated selection of tenants including grocers and eateries for ultimate convenience. Residential and retail spaces have separate entrances to ensure privacy for residents. 520 sq ft (1 Bedroom, 1 Bathroom) 604 sq ft - 651 sq ft (1+1 Bedrooms, 1 Bathroom) 1,010 sq ft - 1,084 sq ft (2+1 Bedrooms, 2 Bathrooms) Up to 1,282 sq ft (3+1 Bedrooms) Noora offers an extensive range of facilities designed to promote wellness, social interaction, and recreation. Key amenities include a gymnasium, floating yoga deck, multi-sport recreation court, and a children's playground. The Leisure and Social Deck on Level 8 features an infinity pool, kids' pool, BBQ pavilions, and a Forest Trail. For professionals, Level 9 hosts a Work Loft and a Makers' Studio. Additionally, each tower boasts a Sky Lounge on Level 37 and a Sky Garden on Level 48 for activities like glamping and star-gazing. As part of the self-contained Desa ParkCity township, residents of Noora enjoy unparalleled access to a complete range of amenities. An integrated 3-storey retail space at the base of the residence. A nearby open-air retail and dining hub with a Village Grocer. An iconic lakeside retail centre. Located approximately 1km away, offering curricula for students from ages 3 to 18. A 300-bed private hospital providing comprehensive medical services, located about 1km from the development. Excellent connectivity via the Damansara-Puchong Expressway (LDP), Duta-Ulu Kelang Expressway (DUKE), Kuala Lumpur Middle Ring Road 2 (MRR2), and the New Klang Valley Expressway (NKVE). Noora is developed by Perdana ParkCity Sdn Bhd (a subsidiary of ParkCity Group), renowned for creating Malaysia's most liveable communities. Desa ParkCity has received prestigious accolades, including the FIABCI World Gold Winner for Best Master Plan in 2019.\n\nView project details\n\nHugo Chong Advertiser\n\nWhatsApp\n\nImage\n\nView Phone Number\n\nImage\n\nSend Enquiry\n\n## FAQs\n\n##### How much does it cost to buy a property in Desa Parkcity, Kuala Lumpur?\n\nThe unit for sale in Desa Parkcity, Kuala Lumpur is RM 1,130,000.\n\n##### Is security available at Noora?\n\nNo.\n\n##### Where is this unit located?\n\nJalan Residen Utama, Desa Parkcity, Kuala Lumpur.\n\n##### What is the estimated repayment loan amount for a unit at Noora?\n\nThe estimated loan repayment amount is RM 4,738 / mo.\n\n##### When was this unit completed?\n\nThe